I hoisted the `profile` member into a local and marked the null check as unlikely, so the common non-null path stays fall-through and avoids redundant member reloads.

```cpp
FIT_UINT8 Field::GetNum(void) const
{
    const auto p = profile;
    if (__builtin_expect(p == NULL, 0))
        return FIT_FIELD_NUM_INVALID;
    return p->fields[profileIndex].num;
}
```